tle":"拟张允怀寄内代内答十首 其七","author":"郑文康","text":"闻君黑发渐成皤，谁信闺人白更多。\n唱惯阊门杨柳曲，无心来听扊扅歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟张允怀寄内代内答十首 其八","author":"郑文康","text":"檀郎踪迹似风蓬，几夜因缘在梦中。\n不及天孙衾与枕，一年犹得一相同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟张允怀寄内代内答十首 其九","author":"郑文康","text":"一灯一影共成三，人问移天只自惭。\n近报归来非诳说，便从窗下种宜男。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟张允怀寄内代内答十首 其十","author":"郑文康","text":"十年隔别面如瓜，无复容颜似舜华。\n只恐到门初下马，一天愁闷悔还家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄栗妻","author":"郑文康","text":"天时人事总堪哀，一妇难当两样灾。\n报与忧民巡抚使，早骑骢马火星来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄栗妻","author":"郑文康","text":"不因洪水为豪民，逼向黄泉送此身。\n巡抚到来烦说与，一时似我尚多人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和钝庵吊乐庵龙洲莲峰半山四古墓 其一","author":"郑文康","text":"白头村妪白头翁，盛事惊看在眼中。\n可惜一抔江上土，野花黄蝶领春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和钝庵吊乐庵龙洲莲峰半山四古墓 其二","author":"郑文康","text":"一篇醉渡浙江词，不是寻常句读诗。\n空有故人三十万，等闲尽付酒家儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27126,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和钝庵吊乐庵龙洲莲峰半山四古墓 其三","author":"郑文康","text":"泗园文脉接莲峰，姓氏曾收县志中。\n只为书声消歇久，子孙谁免哭途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27127,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和钝庵吊乐庵龙洲莲峰半山四古墓 其四","author":"郑文康","text":"清江百里古名娄，总管佳城此地留。\n龙虎气消君莫怨，新漕风景更多愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27128,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿山中人","author":"郑文康","text":"羔羊春酒杂仙桃，两鬓秋霜一布袍。\n白鹿青骡来会者，滑稽方朔最年高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王同知梅花","author":"郑文康","text":"少年头角老成身，一寸心中万古春。\n清白自然颜色好，江南歌咏有诗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古墓","author":"郑文康","text":"野梅荒草水边坟，无处从人问子孙。\n三尺断碑今又失，几多遗恨夕阳村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送老兵","author":"郑文康","text":"剑光如火马如飞，破敌曾随大将车。\n斗酒彘肩常不饱，胸中磊块尽兵书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题吕推官凤池春雨竹","author":"郑文康","text":"凤凰池上凤凰翎，带雨离披舞舜庭。\n分得一枝盱郡里，清风常满节推厅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"班姬","author":"郑文康","text":"阳阿祸水洒涂椒，从此刘家火渐消。\n莫恃齐纨长在手，西风容易到芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徐氏隐居","author":"郑文康","text":"南山杨柳北山桑，山下人家礼义乡。\n携取旧书辞旧隐，愿从东壁借余光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":27135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]